# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY — not needed when running inside Jules.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# On Jules' VM, credentials are provided automatically via:
#   - Vertex AI Application Default Credentials (AI classification)
#   - Existing repository git credentials (data branch push)
#
# To develop locally, choose ONE of the following auth options:
#
# Option A — GCP Application Default Credentials (recommended):
#   1. Run: gcloud auth application-default login
#   2. Set GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT below
#
# Option B — Direct Gemini API key:
#   Set GEMINI_API_KEY below
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Option A: GCP project (used with ADC / Vertex AI)
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-gcp-project-id

# Option B: Gemini API key (fallback if Vertex AI is unavailable)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here

# Only needed locally to push to the data branch (Jules uses its own git creds)
# GITHUB_PAT=your-github-personal-access-token
# GITHUB_REPO=tenghuey-ai/jules-ph-worker
